WEBVTT

00:11:28.894 --> 00:11:31.862
(Laughter)

00:11:31.886 --> 00:11:33.679
And I answered, "Yes, we do."

00:11:33.703 --> 00:11:34.757
(Laughter)

00:11:34.781 --> 00:11:37.539
And then he said,
"Why would they vote for him?"

00:11:38.412 --> 00:11:40.128
And I remember stopping and thinking

00:11:40.152 --> 00:11:42.952
that it was really important
how I answered this question.

00:11:43.589 --> 00:11:46.351
Somehow, I had to honor
our own family values

00:11:46.375 --> 00:11:48.184
and show respect for our friends.

00:11:48.877 --> 00:11:50.449
So I finally said,

00:11:50.473 --> 00:11:53.141
"They think that's the right direction
for this country."

00:11:53.165 --> 00:11:55.959
And before I had even gotten
the whole sentence out,

00:11:55.983 --> 00:11:59.126
he had moved on to the soccer game
he was going to play at recess.

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:00.322
CQ: So life with boys.